Hi all,

Some of you asked about the sick leave reform that was announced in the
press this week. Short update below.

This is a DRAFT. The text has not been voted yet.

According to the draft we received, the government wants to extend the
relapse period for white-collar employees from 14 days to 4 weeks, and
possibly longer. There is also a plan to let larger employers pay part
of the sickness benefit, but no details yet.

Please do not communicate anything to clients before the law is
published in the Belgian Official Gazette. Until then the current rule
(14 days) remains applicable.

I will update the policy as soon as we have the final text.

